{"title":"程序语言的常见设计错误(2) - 试图容纳世界","comparisons":{"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20130422.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20090101.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20130422.html","from_date":"2009-01-01","to_date":"2013-04-22","counts":{"added":1,"removed":1,"changed":2},"preview":"作者：王垠","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><p>作者：王垠</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">好吧，这真是太方便了。然后你就遇到这样的问题，你要给这世界上的每个人戴一顶帽子。当你写这段代码的时候，你意识中每个人都有头，所以你写了一个函数叫做<ins> </ins>putOnHat，它的输入参数是任意一个人，然后它会给他（她）的头上戴上帽子。然后你想把这个函数 map 到一个国家的所有人的集合。</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">怎么办呢？所以你想出了一个办法，把“正常人”单独放在一个列表里，其它的怪人另外处理。于是你就希望有一个办法，让别人无法把那些怪人放进这个列表里。你想要的其实就是 Java 里的“类型”，像这样：<del> List&lt;有一个头和两只手的正常人&gt; normalPeople;</del></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><pre><code>List&lt;有一个头和两只手的正常人&gt; normalPeople;\n</code></pre></div>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20140804.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20130422.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20140804.html","from_date":"2013-04-22","to_date":"2014-08-04","counts":{"added":1,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"（王垠 yinwang.org 版权所有，未经许可，请勿转载）","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>（王垠 yinwang.org 版权所有，未经许可，请勿转载）</p></div>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20161001.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20140804.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20161001.html","from_date":"2014-08-04","to_date":"2016-10-01","counts":{"added":0,"removed":1,"changed":0},"preview":"（王垠 yinwang.org 版权所有，未经许可，请勿转载）","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><p>（王垠 yinwang.org 版权所有，未经许可，请勿转载）</p></div>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20170510.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20161001.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20170510.html","from_date":"2016-10-01","to_date":"2017-05-10","counts":{"added":0,"removed":3,"changed":0},"preview":"很可惜，Python 不提供给你这种机制，因为这种机制按照 Python 的“哲学”，不足以容纳这个世界的博大精深的万千变化。让程序员手工给参数和变量写上类型，被认为是“过多的劳动”。","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><p>很可惜，Python 不提供给你这种机制，因为这种机制按照 Python 的“哲学”，不足以容纳这个世界的博大精深的万千变化。让程序员手工给参数和变量写上类型，被认为是“过多的劳动”。</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><p>这个问题也存在于 JavaScript 和 Ruby。</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><p>语言的设计者们都应该明白，程序语言不是用来“构造世界”的，而只是对它进行简单的模拟。试图容纳世界的倾向，没带来很多好处，没有节省程序员很多精力，却使得代码完全没有规则可言。这就像生活在一个没有规则，没有制度，没有法律的世界，经常发生无法预料的事情，到处跑着没有头，三只手，六只眼的怪人。这是无穷无尽的烦恼和时间精力的浪费。</p></div>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20171024.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20170510.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20171024.html","from_date":"2017-05-10","to_date":"2017-10-24","counts":{"added":0,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"","html":"<p class=\"diff-empty\">两个版本的正文没有可见差异。</p>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20171025.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20171024.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20171025.html","from_date":"2017-10-24","to_date":"2017-10-25","counts":{"added":3,"removed":0,"changed":3},"preview":"作者：王垠","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>作者：王垠</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">好吧，这真是太方便了。然后你就遇到这样的问题，你要给这世界上的每个人戴一顶帽子。当你写这段代码的时候，你意识中每个人都有头，所以你写了一个函数叫做<del> </del>putOnHat，它的输入参数是任意一个人，然后它会给他（她）的头上戴上帽子。然后你想把这个函数 map 到一个国家的所有人的集合。</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">怎么办呢？所以你想出了一个办法，把“正常人”单独放在一个列表里，其它的怪人另外处理。于是你就希望有一个办法，让别人无法把那些怪人放进这个列表里。你想要的其实就是 Java 里的“类型”，像这样：<ins> List&lt;有一个头和两只手的正常人&gt; normalPeople;</ins></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>List&lt;有一</del><ins>很可惜，Python 不提供给你这种机制，因为这种机制按照 Python 的“哲学”，不足以容纳这</ins>个<del>头</del><ins>世界的博大精深的万千变化。让程序员手工给参数</ins>和<del>两只手</del><ins>变量写上类型，被认为是“过多</ins>的<del>正常人&gt; normalPeople;</del><ins>劳动”。</ins></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>这个问题也存在于 JavaScript 和 Ruby。</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>语言的设计者们都应该明白，程序语言不是用来“构造世界”的，而只是对它进行简单的模拟。试图容纳世界的倾向，没带来很多好处，没有节省程序员很多精力，却使得代码完全没有规则可言。这就像生活在一个没有规则，没有制度，没有法律的世界，经常发生无法预料的事情，到处跑着没有头，三只手，六只眼的怪人。这是无穷无尽的烦恼和时间精力的浪费。</p></div>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20171124.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20171025.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20171124.html","from_date":"2017-10-25","to_date":"2017-11-24","counts":{"added":1,"removed":1,"changed":2},"preview":"作者：王垠","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><p>作者：王垠</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">好吧，这真是太方便了。然后你就遇到这样的问题，你要给这世界上的每个人戴一顶帽子。当你写这段代码的时候，你意识中每个人都有头，所以你写了一个函数叫做<ins> </ins>putOnHat，它的输入参数是任意一个人，然后它会给他（她）的头上戴上帽子。然后你想把这个函数 map 到一个国家的所有人的集合。</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">怎么办呢？所以你想出了一个办法，把“正常人”单独放在一个列表里，其它的怪人另外处理。于是你就希望有一个办法，让别人无法把那些怪人放进这个列表里。你想要的其实就是 Java 里的“类型”，像这样：<del> List&lt;有一个头和两只手的正常人&gt; normalPeople;</del></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><pre class=\"highlight\"><code>List&lt;有一个头和两只手的正常人&gt; normalPeople;\n</code></pre></div>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20180324.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20171124.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20180324.html","from_date":"2017-11-24","to_date":"2018-03-24","counts":{"added":0,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"","html":"<p class=\"diff-empty\">两个版本的正文没有可见差异。</p>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20191206.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20180324.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20191206.html","from_date":"2018-03-24","to_date":"2019-12-06","counts":{"added":0,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"","html":"<p class=\"diff-empty\">两个版本的正文没有可见差异。</p>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20200228.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20191206.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20200228.html","from_date":"2019-12-06","to_date":"2020-02-28","counts":{"added":0,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"","html":"<p class=\"diff-empty\">两个版本的正文没有可见差异。</p>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20240416.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20200228.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_18_language-design-mistake2_20240416.html","from_date":"2020-02-28","to_date":"2024-04-16","counts":{"added":0,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"","html":"<p class=\"diff-empty\">两个版本的正文没有可见差异。</p>"}}}